        "backend": "faster_whisper",
        "reason": "WER 0.0%",
        "transcript": "I just got an email from the internship coordinator. Apparently, our start date has been pushed back two weeks. Really, I thought we were supposed to begin on June 1st. What happened? The company is relocating to a new office building, and it won't be ready until mid-June. So now, we start on the 15th instead. Well, that's actually not too bad. I can use the extra time to finish my online certification course. Same here. I was stressing about completing everything before the internship. This gives us some breathing room.",
